        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "ウェーイからの～～……ウィ～～ッッ♪",
            "enText": "We'll hit 'em with a whahey and a woo♪",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -5774231579108995483,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "なんか盛り上がってんじゃん。\r\nどしたの？",
            "enText": "You both seem excited. Something happen?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -7753141986139326289,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "あははははっ！　もうねっ、サイコー！！\r\nテンアゲしか勝たん☆",
            "enText": "Ahahaha! Have I got a story for you! \nNo choice but to shake it off☆",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -8589327172728931789,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "わかりみ～！　生類わかりみの令～！",
            "enText": "You got that right, sis! And all us peeps \nare here to party with ya!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7742581557554382724,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "2人ともちょっと落ち着きなって。\r\nなに、なんのお祝い？",
            "enText": "All right, let's calm down. \nWhat's the occasion?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -2789680699785860554,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "んじゃ、シチーもいっしょに職員室行くべ♪",
            "enText": "Find out by coming to the faculty room \nwith us♪",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -263478977980577664,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "は？　職員室ってなんで？",
            "enText": "Huh? Why the faculty room?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -8846312006761068902,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "宿題ぜ～んぶ忘れたから！　5教科の先生\r\n全員に怒られるとかマジウケるっしょ～！",
            "enText": "Well I kinda blanked on doing aaall my \nhomework! Five subjects worth of teachers \nare on my case now! Hilarious, right?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 2564265457288657200,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "もう、あげみざわでパリピるしかないし！？\r\nつーか5教科とか逆にアリよりのアリ！\n大記録ウェ～～イッ！！",
            "enText": "My sides are in party mode already, how can\nwe not celebrate!? And like, five? Actually\nmakes it sound more legit! You're settin' \na world record for suuuure!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 5606810410684322340,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "はぁ……付き合ってあげるから、\r\n頑張って謝んなよ。",
            "enText": "<i>Sigh.</i>… All right, I'll tag along. \nJust make sure to properly apologize.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -8752429165808765574,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "ううぅ……2人ともマジ感謝～～……。",
            "enText": "<i>Ooogh</i>… Appreciate you two for real.",
